get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/users/designations
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  ### List Designations
  Retrieves all job designations configured in the system for dropdown selection during user invitation.

  **Authentication:** Requires `access_token`.

  **Response:**
  - `200 OK`: Returns array of designation objects `{ success: true, data: [{ id, name, code, is_active }] }`.
}
